"seek": 11760, "start": 140.45999999999998, "end": 142.84, "text": " Pharisees and teachers of the law were sitting there,", "tokens": [51508, 47742, 279, 293, 6023, 295, 264, 2101, 645, 3798, 456, 11, 51627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14966781740266133, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013247935567051172}, {"id": 39, "seek": 11760, "start": 142.84, "end": 147.56, "text": " who had come from every village of Galilee and Judea and from Jerusalem,", "tokens": [51627, 567, 632, 808, 490, 633, 7288, 295, 7336, 33914, 293, 36521, 64, 293, 490, 15393, 11, 51863], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14966781740266133, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013247935567051172}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14760, "start": 148.26, "end": 150.78, "text": " and the power of the Lord was with him to heal.", "tokens": [50398, 293, 264, 1347, 295, 264, 3257, 390, 365, 796, 281, 10526, 13, 50524], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14760, "start": 151.54, "end": 155.51999999999998, "text": " And behold, some men were bringing on a bed a man who was paralyzed,", "tokens": [50562, 400, 27234, 11, 512, 1706, 645, 5062, 322, 257, 2901, 257, 587, 567, 390, 41919, 11, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14760, "start": 156.0, "end": 159.04, "text": " and they were seeking to bring him in and lay him before Jesus.", "tokens": [50785, 293, 436, 645, 11670, 281, 1565, 796, 294, 293, 2360, 796, 949, 2705, 13, 50937], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14760, "start": 159.51999999999998, "end": 162.29999999999998, "text": " But finding no way to bring him in because of the crowd,", "tokens": [50961, 583, 5006, 572, 636, 281, 1565, 796, 294, 570, 295, 264, 6919, 11, 51100], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 44, "seek": 14760, "start": 162.7, "end": 165.62, "text": " they went up on the roof and let him down with his bed", "tokens": [51120, 436, 1437, 493, 322, 264, 8418, 293, 718, 796, 760, 365, 702, 2901, 51266], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14760, "start": 165.62, "end": 168.32, "text": " through the tiles into the midst before Jesus.", "tokens": [51266, 807, 264, 21982, 666, 264, 18629, 949, 2705, 13, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 46, "seek": 14760, "start": 169.01999999999998, "end": 171.51999999999998, "text": " And when he saw their faith, he said,", "tokens": [51436, 400, 562, 415, 1866, 641, 4522, 11, 415, 848, 11, 51561], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 47, "seek": 14760, "start": 172.18, "end": 175.24, "text": " Man, your sins are forgiven you.", "tokens": [51594, 2458, 11, 428, 13815, 366, 30391, 291, 13, 51747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 48, "seek": 14760, "start": 175.9, "end": 177.5, "text": " And the scribes and the Pharisees,", "tokens": [51780, 400, 264, 39435, 279, 293, 264, 47742, 279, 11, 51860], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17740088362034742, "compression_ratio": 1.7588932806324111, "no_speech_prob": 0.005553798284381628}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17760, "start": 177.6, "end": 179.26, "text": " they began to question, saying,", "tokens": [50365, 436, 4283, 281, 1168, 11, 1566, 11, 50448], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17760, "start": 180.04, "end": 182.16, "text": " Who is this who speaks blasphemies?", "tokens": [50487, 2102, 307, 341, 567, 10789, 46409, 41245, 530, 30, 50593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 51, "seek": 17760, "start": 182.48, "end": 184.82, "text": " Who can forgive sins but God alone?", "tokens": [50609, 2102, 393, 10718, 13815, 457, 1265, 3312, 30, 50726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17760, "start": 185.46, "end": 188.92, "text": " When Jesus perceived their thoughts, he answered them,", "tokens": [50758, 1133, 2705, 19049, 641, 4598, 11, 415, 10103, 552, 11, 50931], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17760, "start": 189.45999999999998, "end": 191.88, "text": " Why do you question in your hearts?", "tokens": [50958, 1545, 360, 291, 1168, 294, 428, 8852, 30, 51079], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17760, "start": 192.57999999999998, "end": 195.38, "text": " Which is easier to say, your sins are forgiven you,", "tokens": [51114, 3013, 307, 3571, 281, 584, 11, 428, 13815, 366, 30391, 291, 11, 51254], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 55, "seek": 17760, "start": 195.48, "end": 197.5, "text": " or to say, rise and walk?", "tokens": [51259, 420, 281, 584, 11, 6272, 293, 1792, 30, 51360], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 56, "seek": 17760, "start": 198.12, "end": 202.12, "text": " But that you may know that the Son of Man has authority on earth to forgive sins,", "tokens": [51391, 583, 300, 291, 815, 458, 300, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 575, 8281, 322, 4120, 281, 10718, 13815, 11, 51591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 57, "seek": 17760, "start": 202.42, "end": 204.72, "text": " he said to the man who was paralyzed,", "tokens": [51606, 415, 848, 281, 264, 587, 567, 390, 41919, 11, 51721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 58, "seek": 17760, "start": 205.26, "end": 207.56, "text": " I say to you, rise,", "tokens": [51748, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 6272, 11, 51863], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2648564200116019, "compression_ratio": 1.6612903225806452, "no_speech_prob": 0.004644504748284817}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20760, "start": 207.92, "end": 210.04, "text": " pick up your bed, and go home.", "tokens": [50381, 1888, 493, 428, 2901, 11, 293, 352, 1280, 13, 50487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20760, "start": 210.78, "end": 212.84, "text": " And immediately he rose up before them", "tokens": [50524, 400, 4258, 415, 10895, 493, 949, 552, 50627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20760, "start": 212.84, "end": 214.72, "text": " and picked up what he had been lying on,", "tokens": [50627, 293, 6183, 493, 437, 415, 632, 668, 8493, 322, 11, 50721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20760, "start": 214.9, "end": 216.88, "text": " and went home glorifying God.", "tokens": [50730, 293, 1437, 1280, 26623, 5489, 1265, 13, 50829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20760, "start": 217.5, "end": 219.6, "text": " And amazement seized them all,", "tokens": [50860, 400, 669, 921, 1712, 33912, 552, 439, 11, 50965], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20760, "start": 220.16, "end": 223.78, "text": " and they glorified God and were filled with awe, saying,", "tokens": [50993, 293, 436, 26623, 2587, 1265, 293, 645, 6412, 365, 30912, 11, 1566, 11, 51174], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 65, "seek": 20760, "start": 224.51999999999998, "end": 226.85999999999999, "text": " We have seen extraordinary things today.", "tokens": [51211, 492, 362, 1612, 10581, 721, 965, 13, 51328], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 66, "seek": 20760, "start": 228.76, "end": 232.0, "text": " After this he went out and saw a tax collector named Levi", "tokens": [51423, 2381, 341, 415, 1437, 484, 293, 1866, 257, 3366, 23960, 4926, 33987, 51585], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 67, "seek": 20760, "start": 232.0, "end": 233.44, "text": " sitting at the tax booth.", "tokens": [51585, 3798, 412, 264, 3366, 20912, 13, 51657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 68, "seek": 20760, "start": 234.04, "end": 235.34, "text": " And he said to him,", "tokens": [51687, 400, 415, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51752], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 69, "seek": 20760, "start": 236.06, "end": 236.95999999999998, "text": " Follow me.", "tokens": [51788, 9876, 385, 13, 51833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24725675153302717, "compression_ratio": 1.6271186440677967, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003654216416180134}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23760, "start": 237.6, "end": 240.16, "text": " And leaving everything, he rose and followed him.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 5012, 1203, 11, 415, 10895, 293, 6263, 796, 13, 50493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23760, "start": 240.7, "end": 243.35999999999999, "text": " And Levi made him a great feast in his house.", "tokens": [50520, 400, 33987, 1027, 796, 257, 869, 23707, 294, 702, 1782, 13, 50653], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 72, "seek": 23760, "start": 243.72, "end": 246.18, "text": " And there was a large company of tax collectors", "tokens": [50671, 400, 456, 390, 257, 2416, 2237, 295, 3366, 35384, 50794], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23760, "start": 246.18, "end": 248.6, "text": " and others reclining at table with them.", "tokens": [50794, 293, 2357, 850, 31079, 412, 3199, 365, 552, 13, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23760, "start": 249.22, "end": 252.66, "text": " And the Pharisees and their scribes grumbled at his disciples, saying,", "tokens": [50946, 400, 264, 47742, 279, 293, 641, 39435, 279, 677, 19928, 412, 702, 17209, 11, 1566, 11, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 75, "seek": 23760, "start": 253.07999999999998, "end": 258.5, "text": " Why do you eat and drink with tax collectors and sinners?", "tokens": [51139, 1545, 360, 291, 1862, 293, 2822, 365, 3366, 35384, 293, 41004, 30, 51410], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 76, "seek": 23760, "start": 259.58, "end": 261.24, "text": " And Jesus answered them,", "tokens": [51464, 400, 2705, 10103, 552, 11, 51547], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 77, "seek": 23760, "start": 262.02, "end": 264.52, "text": " Those who are well have no need of a physician,", "tokens": [51586, 3950, 567, 366, 731, 362, 572, 643, 295, 257, 16456, 11, 51711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 78, "seek": 23760, "start": 264.88, "end": 266.0, "text": " but those who are sick.", "tokens": [51729, 457, 729, 567, 366, 4998, 13, 51785], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 79, "seek": 23760, "start": 266.54, "end": 267.58, "text": " I have not come to call you,", "tokens": [51812, 286, 362, 406, 808, 281, 818, 291, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18844021067899816, "compression_ratio": 1.6755725190839694, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002531500649638474}, {"id": 80, "seek": 26758, "start": 267.58, "end": 269.88, "text": " but sinners to repentance.", "tokens": [50365, 457, 41004, 281, 37593, 13, 50480], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 81, "seek": 26758, "start": 270.9, "end": 271.96, "text": " And they said to him,", "tokens": [50531, 400, 436, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50584], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 82, "seek": 26758, "start": 272.74, "end": 275.5, "text": " The disciples of John fast often and offer prayers,", "tokens": [50623, 440, 17209, 295, 2619, 2370, 2049, 293, 2626, 16860, 11, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 83, "seek": 26758, "start": 275.78, "end": 277.62, "text": " and so do the disciples of the Pharisees,", "tokens": [50775, 293, 370, 360, 264, 17209, 295, 264, 47742, 279, 11, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 84, "seek": 26758, "start": 277.91999999999996, "end": 279.53999999999996, "text": " but yours eat and drink.", "tokens": [50882, 457, 6342, 1862, 293, 2822, 13, 50963], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 85, "seek": 26758, "start": 280.26, "end": 281.5, "text": " And Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [50999, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51061], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 86, "seek": 26758, "start": 282.32, "end": 285.29999999999995, "text": " Can you make wedding guests fast while the bridegroom is with them?", "tokens": [51102, 1664, 291, 652, 8523, 9804, 2370, 1339, 264, 22292, 70, 2861, 307, 365, 552, 30, 51251], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 87, "seek": 26758, "start": 286.09999999999997, "end": 289.0, "text": " The days will come when the bridegroom is taken away from them,", "tokens": [51291, 440, 1708, 486, 808, 562, 264, 22292, 70, 2861, 307, 2726, 1314, 490, 552, 11, 51436], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 88, "seek": 26758, "start": 289.34, "end": 291.78, "text": " and then they will fast in those days.", "tokens": [51453, 293, 550, 436, 486, 2370, 294, 729, 1708, 13, 51575], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 89, "seek": 26758, "start": 292.28, "end": 294.28, "text": " He also told them a parable.", "tokens": [51600, 634, 611, 1907, 552, 257, 971, 712, 13, 51700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 90, "seek": 26758, "start": 295.03999999999996, "end": 297.08, "text": " No one tears a piece from a new garment", "tokens": [51738, 883, 472, 10462, 257, 2522, 490, 257, 777, 35084, 51840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 91, "seek": 26758, "start": 297.08, "end": 297.56, "text": " and puts it on a new one.", "tokens": [51840, 293, 8137, 309, 322, 257, 777, 472, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19792688699593222, "compression_ratio": 1.7376425855513309, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008693154086358845}, {"id": 92, "seek": 29756, "start": 297.56, "end": 300.8, "text": " If he does, he will tear the new,", "tokens": [50365, 759, 415, 775, 11, 415, 486, 12556, 264, 777, 11, 50527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}, {"id": 93, "seek": 29756, "start": 300.92, "end": 302.98, "text": " and the piece from the new will not match the old.", "tokens": [50533, 293, 264, 2522, 490, 264, 777, 486, 406, 2995, 264, 1331, 13, 50636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}, {"id": 94, "seek": 29756, "start": 303.66, "end": 306.86, "text": " And no one puts new wine into old wineskins.", "tokens": [50670, 400, 572, 472, 8137, 777, 7209, 666, 1331, 35970, 10277, 13, 50830], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}, {"id": 95, "seek": 29756, "start": 307.3, "end": 310.06, "text": " If he does, the new wine will burst the skins,", "tokens": [50852, 759, 415, 775, 11, 264, 777, 7209, 486, 12712, 264, 27888, 11, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}, {"id": 96, "seek": 29756, "start": 310.16, "end": 312.82, "text": " and it will be spilled, and the skins will be destroyed.", "tokens": [50995, 293, 309, 486, 312, 37833, 11, 293, 264, 27888, 486, 312, 8937, 13, 51128], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}, {"id": 97, "seek": 29756, "start": 313.6, "end": 316.64, "text": " But new wine must be put into fresh wineskins,", "tokens": [51167, 583, 777, 7209, 1633, 312, 829, 666, 4451, 35970, 10277, 11, 51319], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}, {"id": 98, "seek": 29756, "start": 317.22, "end": 319.78, "text": " and no one after drinking old wine desires new,", "tokens": [51348, 293, 572, 472, 934, 7583, 1331, 7209, 18005, 777, 11, 51476], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}, {"id": 99, "seek": 29756, "start": 320.2, "end": 323.38, "text": " for he says, The old is good.", "tokens": [51497, 337, 415, 1619, 11, 440, 1331, 307, 665, 13, 51656], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20595236278715587, "compression_ratio": 1.914438502673797, "no_speech_prob": 0.0035347221419215202}], "language": "English"}